SELECT '7d383589-417a-4759-ba67-978a43da1435',id,user_id,'user','revision','Automated acceptance feedback on the preserved v007 CNN draft. Please make three bounded corrections while continuing the same 20-page task. (1) cnn-19-held-out, Math node math-rule: the fixed expression 6/8=75% is not labeled as a baseline, although the editable training code updates the individual held-out predictions. Make the current accuracy/count derive from the same worker result as those predictions, or explicitly distinguish the baseline (30 epochs, learning rate 0.15) from the current result. Verify a changed run such as learning rate 0: the independently checked result is 4/8, not the fixed 6/8. Do not imply general-image performance. (2) cnn-04-dot-product, math-rule: the arithmetic example ending in 7 stays fixed when K00 changes. Bind the example to current values or label it clearly as the K00=1 baseline; the live products and sum already update. (3) cnn-14-gradient-check, fixture-mode Math#math-rule (x28,y600,w450,h48,fontSize21,padding0): actual normal/overflow-visible screenshot comparison confirms slight clipping of the four numerator parentheses, about 0.48 CSS px at 1280x720 and 0.67px at 800x600. It remains readable, but add roughly 2-4px of top padding or equivalent space and recheck the lower edge/footer. Do not solve it by letting overflow cover neighboring content. The current lower glyph clearance is about8.82px/6.86px. All 20 scenes now load local fonts without CSP/font failures. Similar strict line-box assertions on scenes09 and12 were false positives: normal/overflow-visible PNGs are identical, with no actual missing ink. Preserve all earlier versions, native editable explanations, validated math/code, scan animations and accepted revisions. Keep this audit wording off teaching slides.','[]','pending',CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000,CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000
FROM jobs WHERE id='db69fb9d-5d27-4fc2-9553-a722e2a5acbc' AND status='running' AND user_id=(SELECT user_id FROM jobs WHERE id='2d8c4072-7aee-4f55-8fb0-8f074de4f8cb' AND title='介绍cnn')
